    {
      "uid": "zhcn:139ded4f6eb8295e2c0e179e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "早上好，训练员。\n……呵呵，看起来还很困呢。\n要我为您冲杯咖啡吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6139da3083d1c67020bb01cd2ca5a41cea18c182de0c360f16ae67c35d6bd8fa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "90000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1110/90000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8a712a5335cf5747c52d135",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天早上莱茵的流星有些萎靡，\n看来湿度会很高。\n体温调节会变得困难，请多加留意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2b151aa24c5c8f6abceb497d74073492beb0aed49be1606c286a849d25498b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "90001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1110/90001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d93ab9f6bb85001dd8f6e91",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然很想就这样开始训练！\n但是还有课……\n真是让人迫不及待啊♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb3ccb3cc4e93207c7ee4e5b90f8469b6173c8635d8c8ee29b8a6f6257f364cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "90002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1110/90002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a0114b4698cdd294152b82a",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……看来，您稍微有些累了的样子。\n如果不嫌弃的话，\n我来陪您转换一下心情吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d754e63b0daae64ae95e4f5549e097776f8bb791496774474c8b64fccdf34fec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "90003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1110/90003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28d277c39498ea0617f661c9",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员，肚子饿了吗？\n我在冰箱里放了夜宵……\n啊，但是……禁止暴饮暴食哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "898f76282ce907ff504e2cbd5d01bded94f4c66b813c0cd8859e0e3d9b2cdb1c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "90004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1110/90004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea89fb0e6bbc8a12537e1094",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……睡不着吗，训练员？\n既然如此，那就共叙夜话吧。\n无论是今天的事，还是未来的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ad87beea0e566c0525aae041e3889d64ce5aafbc63c58a22257f3ef6cc7a489",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "90005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1110/90005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecf9394d7e65e181db363856",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽说『春眠不觉晓』，\n但春天正是最适合训练的季节。\n今天也要鼓起干劲……哈啊……失、失礼了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd526000b0a7200077860bffa7686a7de7695cca32a497c2b0a99fe946092254",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "90006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1110/90006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f758847bd921fd7d4811687",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "暑假的公园，真不错呢。\n孩子们做体操、玩耍……\n呵呵，这会成为我坚持跑步的动力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a58b29340794cc8fae2ddab6e04ca4599b14cba4ec14aa0e9d8de0d5e30462ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "90007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1110/90007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2f436eb1c0efc89d64b428d",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是因为度过了严酷的夏天吗。\n我迫不及待地盼望着比赛……不知不觉，\n好几次都在保养决胜服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "998934c3b05be5bfd3b4286af460070adb01b892bc28369c99f72f4eecaaafcb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "90008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1110/90008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f6d2d801632138744006f61",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "火锅♪火锅♪……呵呵呵。\n今天和同期的大家一起吃火锅哦！\n这次要做什么装饰锅好呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1a2880b2ed66ff9bea0bb9499feea86cf3c191d5f647c169ba96b78ddc25bbb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "90009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1110/90009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7170decfd72bb90d67b8b96d",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯，包和服装都没问题。\n那么……今天也两个人，\n一起走下去吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d01b0f38c06435fafb35a6736b33c0c6bf3ed76ef409f9cef2e8345172a76b46",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "90010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1110/90010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:026a926e06cc91a186060bfe",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能完成早上的First Look，\n真是太好了。为了光辉的未来，\n今天也一起励精图治吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "560ce69fd430a83150e1ee148cf6ac47d3ee4b274a2b52504011f38b25d8cdf6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "90011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1110/90011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdca31b7879182d8fe01ee76",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "便当，我放在桌子上了。\n营养，还有您喜欢的东西。\n装得满满当当的哦！",
