    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be35a89fc9137c5b42054b08",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "和风的装饰配上洋风的礼服……\n我会将两者都驾驭给您看。\n统以此二国，以此为更坚固的基石。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a95c185f173f6f4cbad00c027fec3782e5a093526307498dbf7131ef566996a",
