      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯。蝴蝶结和腰带都很完美！\n……久等了，训练员。\n开始训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29f2a07594e851fae9bb129720342378767d3e5d3c033c2c184f98e5745df5c3",
